it's all long game.

00:03:00.049 --> 00:03:00.681
- [Aubrey] Yeah.

00:03:00.681 --> 00:03:03.450
- [Gary] You're either playing
for life or your playing for the

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:04.985
few minutes ahead of you.

00:03:04.985 --> 00:03:08.488
And again, this keeps going back
over and over in my mind to what

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:10.440
other people think.

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.985
It's gonna be a good one.

00:03:11.985 --> 00:03:15.178
