other people have to say.

00:03:23.186 --> 00:03:26.726
You give up on that shit and
you're clean and you can go.

00:03:26.726 --> 00:03:29.606
And all of a sudden, it's not
how much money you have or how

00:03:29.606 --> 00:03:32.362
